  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under Section 469, passive losses offset only passive income. Morrison''s $30,000 passive income from Activity A absorbs $30,000 of the $50,000 loss, leaving $20,000 suspended. Upon full taxable disposition of Activity B, all suspended losses from that activity are released and deductible against any income type, including wages.
